        "| *\"Handling Missing Data\"* — Pandas docs | Documentación | Básico | https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/user_guide/missing_data.html |\n",
        "| *Data Quality: The Accuracy Dimension* — Jack Olson | Libro | Referencia | Morgan Kaufmann |\n",
        "| *\"The 5 most common data problems\"* — Towards Data Science | Artículo | Básico | https://towardsdatascience.com |"
      ]
    },
